<title>USA: St Paul hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts compared with Friday, were $0.50 lower. Top $59.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     220-250 lbs   59.00</p>
<p>		   250-260 lbs   58.50-59.00</p>
<p>		   260-270 lbs   57.50-58.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3     270-280 lbs   56.50-57.50</p>
<p>    US 2-4     280-290 lbs   55.50-56.50</p>
<p>	 Sows - up $0.50-2.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     300-450 lbs   46.00</p>
<p>		   450-500 lbs   47.00</p>
<p>		   500-550 lbs   48.00-49.00</p>
<p>		   550-700 lbs   50.00</p>
</text>
